{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31917","headline":"寄李輈侍郎 · 贾岛","name":"寄李輈侍郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"终过盟津书，分明梦不虚。\n人从清渭别，地隔太行余。\n宾幕谁嫌静，公门但晏如。\n櫑鞞乾霹雳，斜汉湿蟾蜍。\n追琢垂今後，敦庞得古初。\n井台怜操筑，漳岸想丕疏。\n亦冀铿珉佩，终当直石渠。\n此身多抱疾，幽里近营居。\n忆漱苏门涧，经浮楚泽瀦。\n松栽侵古影，荤断尚芹葅。\n语嘿曾延接，心源离滓淤。\n谁言姓琴氏，独跨角生鱼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31917.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31917","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}